<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）负责。我们都问他能否休息这个周末，这周工作五天而不是七天。他的回复。

00:58:41.170 --> 00:58:45.170
<v Dave Ramsey>You're not willing to work? I don't know anything to call that but lazy.
<v Dave Ramsey>你不愿意工作？我不知道除了懒惰还能称为什么。

00:58:45.170 --> 00:58:49.300
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
